{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Game Start\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-07\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Before the U.A. students head to their training camp, Class 1-A goes to the pool for extra training, and the League of Villains plots their next move.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6341861.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ゲーム・スタート\"},{\"title\":\"Wild, Wild Pussycats\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-14\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Class 1-A faces the first challenge of their summer training camp when they have to fight their way through \\\"The Beast's Forest\\\" before lunch.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633228.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ワイルド・ワイルド・プッシーキャッツ\"},{\"title\":\"Kota\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-21\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Midoriya tries to talk with Kota as the first-years start their training in earnest. Little do they know what awaits them in the forest.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633229.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"洸汰くん\"},{\"title\":\"My Hero\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-28\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The villains launch their attack, and only Izuku knows where Kota is. Can he get to him in time?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633230.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"僕のヒーロー\"},{\"title\":\"Drive It Home, Iron Fist!!!\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-05\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Izuku finally makes it back to the training camp only to leave again with a message for Mandalay to broadcast.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633231.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ブチ込む鉄拳!!!\"},{\"title\":\"Roaring Upheaval\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-12\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Students and teachers of UJS are still fighting in the woods, but the Vanguard avant-garde team has already accomplished its mission ...?!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633232.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"がなる風雲急\"},{\"title\":\"What a Twist!\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-19\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The battle at the training camp concludes, and now the students and teachers of U.A. have to deal with the aftermath.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633233.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"転転転!\"},{\"title\":\"From Iida to Midoriya\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-26\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Todoroki, Kirishima, and Midoriya want to go after Bakugo, but the class rep is standing in their way. Meanwhile, Shigaraki makes Bakugo an offer…\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633234.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"飯田から緑谷へ\"},{\"title\":\"All for One\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-02\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The heroes and U.A. students close in on the League of Villains' hideouts, but the League still has an ace up its sleeve…\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633235.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"オール・フォー・ワン\"},{\"title\":\"Symbol of Peace\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-09\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As the fight against the League of Villains escalates, can the U.A. students get Bakugo out in time for All Might to make a big comeback?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633236.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"平和の象徴\"},{\"title\":\"One for All\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-16\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"All Might's time is running out as he faces his ultimate nemesis head on. Will he finally be able to defeat All For One once and for all?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633237.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ワン・フォー・オール\"},{\"title\":\"End of the Beginning, Beginning of the End\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-23\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"After All Might and All For One's fight, the students go back home while the U.A. teachers decide how to deal with the aftermath.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633238.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"始まりの終わり 終わりの始まり\"},{\"title\":\"Moving into Dorms\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2018-06-30\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The students of Class 1-A move into the dorms and have a competition to determine who has the best room as they settle in.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633239.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"入れ寮\"},{\"title\":\"Create Those Ultimate Moves\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-14\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Class 1-A works on developing their Quirks and creating ultimate moves in order to get ready for the provisional hero licensing exam.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633240.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"編め必殺技\"},{\"title\":\"The Test\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-21\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Izuku and his classmates make some final adjustments to their ultimate moves and then head off to the provisional licensing exam.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633241.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"THE試験\"},{\"title\":\"Shiketsu High Lurking\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2018-07-28\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The provisional licensing exam has begun, and everyone's after Class 1-A! Can they last long enough to pass this first test?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633242.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"這い寄る士傑高校\"},{\"title\":\"Class 1-A\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-04\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Todoroki's on his own against Seijin High, and Yaoyorozu's group is pitted against Seiai Academy as they and the rest of Class 1-A fight to pass the first test.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633243.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"1年A組\"},{\"title\":\"Rush!\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-11\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"It's down to the final minutes of the first test of the provisional licensing exam and almost half of Class A is still left…\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633244.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"RUSH!\"},{\"title\":\"Rescue Exercises\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-18\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The second test of the provisional licensing exam has begun, and the hero candidates are suddenly thrust into a rescue operation.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633245.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"救助演習\"},{\"title\":\"Save the World with Love!\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-25\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"We take a break from the provisional licensing exam to visit a class held before the summer training camp!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633246.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"愛で地球を救え!\"},{\"title\":\"What`s the Big Idea?\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-01\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The exam nears its end, but Izuku and the other hero candidates must fend off Gang Orca to finish the rescue mission.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633247.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"何をしてんだよ\"},{\"title\":\"A Talk About Your Quirk\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-08\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"While the U.A. students finish up the provisional licensing exam and get their results, All Might has a talk with All For One.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633248.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"てめェの\\\"個性\\\"の話だ\"},{\"title\":\"Deku vs. Kacchan, Part 2\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-15\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Following the provisional licensing exam, Izuku tries out his Shoot Style on Bakugo as they have a heart-to-heart through their fight.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633249.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"デクvsかっちゃん2\"},{\"title\":\"A Season for Encounters\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-22\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The world has changed for villains and heroes alike in the weeks after All Might's fight with All For One, and the U.A. students start their second semester.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/6633250.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"出会いの季節\"},{\"title\":\"Unrivaled\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-29\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The students of Class 1-A learn about work studies from the Big Three. Meanwhile, the villains also prepare their next steps.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/65d340256d7d2.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"無敵\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}